keywords:
  - water resources
  - environmental impact assessment
  - multi-criteria decision analysis
  - Leopold matrix
  - Flutter
abstract: "Bilingual (Arabic/English) offline-first Flutter application for criteria-based screening of the environmental, social, and economic impacts of water infrastructure projects. It implements a Leopold-matrix scoring engine over 38 criteria in three weighted dimensions (environmental, social, economic), aggregates them into a composite index, and generates severity-tiered mitigation recommendations mapped to the IFC Performance Standards, the World Bank Environmental and Social Framework, and related international frameworks."
